  "result": "Perfect! All 171 tests pass. The payments module is complete with:\n\n**New files:**\n- **src/payments.js** \u2014 Records payments on issued invoices and tracks balance due\n- **test/payments.test.js** \u2014 20 comprehensive tests for the payment system\n\n**Changes to src/errors.js:**\n- `NOT_ISSUED` \u2014 Can only record payments on issued or partially_paid invoices\n- `OVERPAYMENT` \u2014 Payment cannot exceed remaining balance\n\n**Key functions:**\n\n`balanceDue(invoice)` \u2014 Returns how much is still owed (invoice total minus all payments)\n\n`recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })` \u2014 Records a payment and returns:\n- `ok(newInvoice)` with status 'paid' (balance reaches zero) or 'partially_paid' (balance remains)\n- Error if not issued, amount invalid, or overpayment\n\n**Features:**\n- Status automatically transitions: issued \u2192 partially_paid \u2192 paid\n- Payments array created if missing, preserves existing payments\n- Amount validated as positive integer in cents\n- Prevents overpayment with OVERPAYMENT error\n- Maintains immutability throughout",
